OL,3,GNEWSASeized criminal cash shared among
OL,4,Acommunity groups
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoney seized from criminals will be
OL,7,Fused to help children who are at risk
OL,8,Fof exclusion and anti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FBradford Bulls Community Foundation is
OL,11,Famong 44 community groups to receive a
OL,12,Fshare of more than #400,000 from the
OL,13,FMayor of West Yorkshire's Safer
OL,14,FCommunities Fund.
OL,16,FSince 2021, the fund, which is financed
OL,17,Ffrom money recovered under the Proceeds
OL,18,Fof Crime Act, has invested more than
OL,19,F#5.3m in projects across the county.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
