OL,3,GNEWSASeized criminal cash shared among
OL,4,Acommunity groups
OL,5,
OL,6,FProject and events manager at the
OL,7,Ffoundation Michelle Pemberton said the
OL,8,Fmoney would "help young people build
OL,9,Fconfidence, make positive choices and
OL,10,Freach their full potential".
